29433773584722,"name":"Jenga Duel [🧱]","desc":"","path":"/game/129433773584722-jenga-duel","slug":"129433773584722-jenga-duel","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/4bf5968afca088f5305294c76634f859fdd9f57d551fa9ad431a1aabc30b4549.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-116a5ba30078f710554de19fe930e871/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":60,"visitor":0,"verified":false,"updatedAt":null,"creator":{"name":"Roblox","type":"User"},"script":{"count":0,"freeCount":0,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":127943464865693,"name":"Bloxrooms [Beta]","desc":"Endless rooms. Familiar places. Nothing is quite right.\n\nBloxrooms takes the games you think you remember and twists them into something that was never supposed to exist. Explore endless levels, uncover strange artifacts, and survive entities that don't follow the rules you thought you knew. The deeper you go, the more reality starts to fall apart. Every room feels familiar—but never exactly how you remember it.\n\n🗺️ Explore Misremembered Levels\nDiscover corrupted areas inspired by games that feel strangely familiar.\n\n👁️ Survive the Unknown\nWatch for entities, study their behavior, and know when to run—or hide.\n\n💎 Scavenge for Artifacts\nSearch each level for valuable artifacts and bring them back for cash.\n\n🛠️ Upgrade Your Gear\nUse your earnings to improve your equipment and push deeper into the rooms.\n\nTags: backrooms, liminal, horror, uncanny, entity, creature, kane pixels, exploration, adventure, survival, nostalgia, scary","path":"/game/127943464865693-bloxrooms","slug":"127943464865693-bloxrooms","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/a216048eb59eedded65c53c85b6297f9c46a13b1c9b8a72df0920229f46dc30e.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-61c6fca833fa862edc156a9284fbbbae/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":60,"visitor":3279002,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-09-12T10:09:42.251Z","creator":{"name":"Bloxrooms Corporation","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":136532079004320,"name":"[NINJA ACADEMY] SHINSEI","desc":"🍃 Shinsei Ninja Academy 🍃\n\nTrain. Improve. Prepare.\n\nShinsei Ninja Academy was created to help players learn and practice the Hand Seal system before the official release of Shinsei. Improve your speed, memorize seal combinations, and prepare yourself for the battles that await in the full game.\n\n🎁 AFK Rewards\nEvery 2 hours and 30 minutes, you'll receive a random reward:\n\nRyo (In-Game Currency)\nClan Spins\nAppearance Spins\n\nAll rewards earned in Shinsei Ninja Academy will be transferred to your account when the main game releases.\n\n💙 Support the Development 💙\nSimply playing helps support the development of Shinsei through playtime. For those who would like to support the project even further, optional donation products are also available within the experience.\n\nWhether you're here to train, AFK for rewards, or support the game, every visit helps us move one step closer to release.\n\nThank you for supporting Shinsei. We can't wait to see you when the full game release!","path":"/game/136532079004320-shinsei","slug":"136532079004320-shinsei","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/204f7dedfafc487c55079438ffeb7a8e0b54c03ff7b309c9a42f230e983e22e2.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-545bd184360c6b1927dca1e298eaee09/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":60,"visitor":308737,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-07-28T14:30:23.176Z","creator":{"name":"Shinsei Community","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":123741324159498,"name":"Psychotic Containment Facility Arcade","desc":"Non vc version\n\ngamepasses on this game will not transfer to the main one ","path":"/game/123741324159498-psychotic-containment-facility-arcade","slug":"123741324159498-psychotic-containment-facility-arcade","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/bef9c53916bbf634a1928738d6830aa5d9f2f93ebd5d47bbcb29d716829e83d5.webp","orig